    "details": "# Problem Description:\n\nThe IPv6 UDP send path for unconnected sockets did not apply the jail\npolicy of rewriting a loopback destination address to the jail\\'s\nprimary IPv6 address.\n\n# Impact:\n\nA process in a classic (non-VNET) jail can send UDP datagrams to\nservices listening on the host\\'s IPv6 loopback address, bypassing jail\nnetwork isolation.\n",
